/*
 * EXPERIMENTAL - not tested on hardware by andr36oid. Keep a copy of the
 * files you replace so you can go back.
 *
 * Panel of R36S-V22 / HL-R36H-V21 / R36XX-V21 boards ("Panel 4 - V22"),
 * a relative of the R36S Panel 4 with a different init sequence, run at
 * 58 MHz. Values from the dArkOSRE port by southoz (dArkOSRE-R36,
 * r36s/R36S-V22 2024-12-18).
 */

